      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.89,
      "end_seconds": 238.97,
      "duration_seconds": 11.08,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's lactose intolerance, and we'll know more once the a coeliac test is back."
