      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.97,
      "end_seconds": 278.2,
      "duration_seconds": 10.23,
      "text": "I think a hydrogen breath test makes sense here, for suspected lactose intolerance try two weeks without dairy and tell me if it makes a difference"
